    "description": "This API enables financial institutions to manage the status of banking accounts by freezing them when necessary. The primary resource is the banking account, which can be placed on hold to prevent transactions. Typical consumers include banking applications and financial service providers that require account status management for compliance or customer service. Use cases often involve risk management, fraud prevention, or customer requests for account security. This API ensures that institutions can effectively control account activity during critical situations.",
